              "content": "Marketing: For prediction markets specifically, the problem is roughly \"nobody's ever heard of prediction markets\" so we're pretty happy when eg Polymarket or Kalshi goes viral; it means more people experience what a prediction market is.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
